{
  "id": 9484227805238,
  "title": "🥳2026 HOT SALE🥳💞50K+ SOLD! 🎨🛁 50% OFF! White Tile Refinishing Paint with Brush – covers stains, waterproof & glossy. Refresh tiles, sinks & toilets without replacing! 🛡️✅",
  "handle": "white-tile-refinishing-paint-with-brush",
  "description": "<p><strong><span style=\"color: #e67e23;\">FEATURES</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">STAIN-COVER TILE REFINISHING PAINT -</span></strong>Revive worn tiles, sinks, and toilets with a smooth white coating that helps hide stains, refresh dull surfaces, and create a cleaner-looking bathroom or kitchen.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0849/9606/3537/files/spp_shopify20260924173002_eff52125febf264d619e20bcc0147bd1.png?v=1790242205\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">WATERPROOF EVERYDAY PROTECTION -</span></strong>Designed for moisture-prone areas, this refinishing paint helps maintain a neat appearance on bathroom and kitchen surfaces exposed to daily splashes and humidity.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0849/9606/3537/files/spp_shopify20260924173008_3e816628e093887f0e5b4283e2441131.png?v=1790242212\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">SMOOTH GLOSSY RENEWAL -</span></strong>Creates a bright, polished look that helps older tile surfaces appear cleaner, more uniform, and visually refreshed without replacing existing fixtures.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0849/9606/3537/files/spp_shopify20260924173015_58568c4e3f66495a62e5619f81dd2c29.png?v=1790242218\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">SIMPLE BRUSH-ON APPLICATION -</span></strong>Use the included brush to coat target areas with control and convenience, making small-space touch-ups and full-surface refresh projects easier to manage.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0849/9606/3537/files/spp_shopify20260924173021_cddf084d2522d05f2bc962db5edb4fb6.png?v=1790242226\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">CLEAN LOOK WITH LESS EFFORT -</span></strong>Restore a brighter bathroom or kitchen look without the mess and cost of replacing fixtures, helping extend the visual life of existing surfaces.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0849/9606/3537/files/spp_shopify20260924173029_66df27238069db00ebe5eda7d378edce.png?v=1790242232\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #e67e23;\">SPEC</span></strong></p>\n<p>Color: White</p>\n<p>Size: Paint container: 8cm (3.1 inches) x 9cm (3.5 inches); Brush: 2.05cm (0.8 inches) x 12.3cm (4.8 inches)</p>\n<p>Material: Alkyd resin, 200# solvent oil, aluminum tripolyphosphate, tannin acid, barium sulfate, bentonite, titanium dioxide</p>\n<p>Net Weight: 300g (10.58 oz)</p>\n<p>Package Includes: 1* White Tile Refinishing Paint with Brush</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #e67e23;\">NOTES</span></strong></p>\n<p>Ensure the surface is completely clean, dry, and free of grease or dust before applying the paint.</p>\n<p>Apply in a well-ventilated area and keep out of reach of children and pets.</p>\n<p>Allow the paint to dry completely for at least 24 hours before exposing it to water or heavy moisture.</p>",
